{
    "title": "TIMEFLIK Watch Face",
    "description": "<b>Google Play's Best for Wear Winner \ud83d\udc4f\ud83d\udc4f\ud83d\udc4f</b>\r\n\r\nGalaxy Watch 6 Series Official Support!\r\nCustomize your Wear OS by Google smartwatches with TIMEFLIK.\r\n<b>INSTALL OUR WATCH APP!!! Set TIMEFLIK watch app in your watch screen to send watch faces properly. </b> \r\n\r\n\u231a\ufe0e <font color=\"#45c9c6\"><b>1,700,000+ watch faces updated by global designers!</b></font>\r\nFreshen up your watch everyday\ud83d\ude0e\r\n\r\n\u231a\ufe0e <font color=\"#45c9c6\"><b>Send to connected watch right away!</b></font>\r\nAll compatible for Galaxy Watch, Wear OS Watches.\r\n(Sorry, Huawei OS, Xiaomi OS, Garmin, FitBit are NOT available.)\r\n\r\n\u231a\ufe0e <font color=\"#45c9c6\"><b>Design your own watch faces.</b></font>\r\nAnyone can be a designer with TIMEFLIK free templates!\r\nCustomize with your photos or free templates like hands, subdials, battery status, even health features; steps, calories, weather and UV index!\r\n\r\n\u231a\ufe0e <font color=\"#45c9c6\"><b>Original Design Collaboration with epic brands! </b></font>\r\nCoca-Cola, T1, Sesame Street, and more! Collaboration watch faces&straps are continuously updated! Which brand will be next?\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25\r\n\r\n\u231a\ufe0e <font color=\"#45c9c6\"><b>Watch Face Subscription, 'FLIK PASS'</b></font>\r\n-Unlimited access to +2,000 Original watch faces\r\n-Exclusive PASS-Only watch faces\r\n-Ad-free app experience.\r\nStart now up to 7-day free trial :)\r\n\r\n\r\n[How to use?]\r\n\r\n1. Install our watch app.\r\n- Google Play : Wear OS by Google / Samsung Galaxy Watch 4, 5, 6 series\r\n- Galaxy Store : TIZEN OS (Samsung Galaxy Watch 3 and below)\r\n2. Set TIMEFLIK as your watch face.\r\n3. In TIMEFLIK mobile app, connect your watch from [My Page - Select My Watch]. Touch the 'OK' button when it finds your watch. Keep the watch display on while connecting. (No AOD mode!)\r\n\r\n<b>\r\nNOT Supported :</b>\r\nHuawei OS (Huawei Watch GT/GT2)\r\nXiaomi OS (Amazfit GTS / Pace / Bip / ... )\r\nFitBit\r\nGarmin\r\n\r\n<b>\r\nSUPPORTED:\r\nWear OS by Google</b>\r\n<li> Samsung Galaxy Watch6 / Watch6 Classic\r\n</li><li> Samsung Galaxy Watch5 / Watch5 Pro\r\n</li><li> Samsung Galaxy Watch4/Watch4 Classic\r\n</li><li> Asus Gen Watch 1, 2, 3\r\n</li><li> CASIO Series\r\n</li><li> Fossil Q Series\r\n</li><li> Guess Wear\r\n</li><li> Huawei Watch 2 Classic/Sport\r\n</li><li> Huawei Watch\r\n</li><li> Hublot Big Bang e\r\n</li><li> LG Watch Series\r\n</li><li> Louis Vuitton Smartwatch\r\n</li><li> Mobvoi Ticwatch Series\r\n</li><li> Montblanc Summit Series\r\n</li><li> Moto 360 Series\r\n</li><li> Movado Series\r\n</li><li> New Balance Run IQ\r\n</li><li> Nixon The Mission\r\n</li><li> Oppo Watch\r\n</li><li> Polar M600\r\n</li><li> Skagen Falster\r\n</li><li> Sony Smartwatch 3\r\n</li><li> SUUNTO 7\r\n</li><li> TAG Heuer Connected\r\n</li><li> Verizon Wireless Wear24\r\n</li><li> ZTE Quartz</li>\r\n\r\n<b>Samsung TIZEN OS smartwatches</b>\r\n<li> Samsung Galaxy Watch3\r\n</li><li> Samsung Galaxy Watch Active2\r\n</li><li> Samsung Galaxy Watch Active\r\n</li><li> Samsung Galaxy Watch\r\n</li><li> Samsung Gear Sport\r\n</li><li> Samsung Gear S3 and below</li>\r\n\r\n[Available in Apple watch? / What about Wear OS Watches not in the list?]\r\nTIMEFLIK Android app has to be synced with TIMEFLIK Wear OS/Tizen watch app. So if you don\u2019t have both Android phone + Wear OS/Tizen smart wearable, please understand its feature will be limited.\r\n\r\n[Access Permission Request(Optional)]\r\n<li> Location: To show weather information precisely based on a location.\r\n</li><li> Storage: To send watch faces or read and write files in smartphones and SD cards.</li>\r\n\r\n[Disclaimer]\r\n<li> This app is unavailable on the smartwatch below Wear OS 2.0.\r\n</li><li> Mobile app installation is necessary for smartwatches powered by Wear OS 2.0. or higher.\r\n</li><li> Some functions of the smartwatch app require interaction with the mobile app.\r\n</li><li> When logging in to the smartwatch app, check the passcode on the mobile and enter it.</li>\r\n\r\n\r\nTIMEFLIK, A new name for watch face app MR TIME",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Google Play&#39;s Best for Wear Winner \ud83d\udc4f\ud83d\udc4f\ud83d\udc4f</b><br><br>Galaxy Watch 6 Series Official Support!<br>Customize your Wear OS by Google smartwatches with TIMEFLIK.<br><b>INSTALL OUR WATCH APP!!! Set TIMEFLIK watch app in your watch screen to send watch faces properly. </b> <br><br>\u231a\ufe0e <font color=\"#45c9c6\"><b>1,700,000+ watch faces updated by global designers!</b></font><br>Freshen up your watch everyday\ud83d\ude0e<br><br>\u231a\ufe0e <font color=\"#45c9c6\"><b>Send to connected watch right away!</b></font><br>All compatible for Galaxy Watch, Wear OS Watches.<br>(Sorry, Huawei OS, Xiaomi OS, Garmin, FitBit are NOT available.)<br><br>\u231a\ufe0e <font color=\"#45c9c6\"><b>Design your own watch faces.</b></font><br>Anyone can be a designer with TIMEFLIK free templates!<br>Customize with your photos or free templates like hands, subdials, battery status, even health features; steps, calories, weather and UV index!<br><br>\u231a\ufe0e <font color=\"#45c9c6\"><b>Original Design Collaboration with epic brands! </b></font><br>Coca-Cola, T1, Sesame Street, and more! Collaboration watch faces&amp;straps are continuously updated! Which brand will be next?\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25\u2764\ufe0f\u200d\ud83d\udd25<br><br>\u231a\ufe0e <font color=\"#45c9c6\"><b>Watch Face Subscription, &#39;FLIK PASS&#39;</b></font><br>-Unlimited access to +2,000 Original watch faces<br>-Exclusive PASS-Only watch faces<br>-Ad-free app experience.<br>Start now up to 7-day free trial :)<br><br><br>[How to use?]<br><br>1. Install our watch app.<br>- Google Play : Wear OS by Google / Samsung Galaxy Watch 4, 5, 6 series<br>- Galaxy Store : TIZEN OS (Samsung Galaxy Watch 3 and below)<br>2. Set TIMEFLIK as your watch face.<br>3. In TIMEFLIK mobile app, connect your watch from [My Page - Select My Watch]. Touch the &#39;OK&#39; button when it finds your watch. Keep the watch display on while connecting. (No AOD mode!)<br><br><b><br>NOT Supported :</b><br>Huawei OS (Huawei Watch GT/GT2)<br>Xiaomi OS (Amazfit GTS / Pace / Bip / ... )<br>FitBit<br>Garmin<br><br><b><br>SUPPORTED:<br>Wear OS by Google</b><br><li> Samsung Galaxy Watch6 / Watch6 Classic<br></li><li> Samsung Galaxy Watch5 / Watch5 Pro<br></li><li> Samsung Galaxy Watch4/Watch4 Classic<br></li><li> Asus Gen Watch 1, 2, 3<br></li><li> CASIO Series<br></li><li> Fossil Q Series<br></li><li> Guess Wear<br></li><li> Huawei Watch 2 Classic/Sport<br></li><li> Huawei Watch<br></li><li> Hublot Big Bang e<br></li><li> LG Watch Series<br></li><li> Louis Vuitton Smartwatch<br></li><li> Mobvoi Ticwatch Series<br></li><li> Montblanc Summit Series<br></li><li> Moto 360 Series<br></li><li> Movado Series<br></li><li> New Balance Run IQ<br></li><li> Nixon The Mission<br></li><li> Oppo Watch<br></li><li> Polar M600<br></li><li> Skagen Falster<br></li><li> Sony Smartwatch 3<br></li><li> SUUNTO 7<br></li><li> TAG Heuer Connected<br></li><li> Verizon Wireless Wear24<br></li><li> ZTE Quartz</li><br><br><b>Samsung TIZEN OS smartwatches</b><br><li> Samsung Galaxy Watch3<br></li><li> Samsung Galaxy Watch Active2<br></li><li> Samsung Galaxy Watch Active<br></li><li> Samsung Galaxy Watch<br></li><li> Samsung Gear Sport<br></li><li> Samsung Gear S3 and below</li><br><br>[Available in Apple watch? / What about Wear OS Watches not in the list?]<br>TIMEFLIK Android app has to be synced with TIMEFLIK Wear OS/Tizen watch app. So if you don\u2019t have both Android phone + Wear OS/Tizen smart wearable, please understand its feature will be limited.<br><br>[Access Permission Request(Optional)]<br><li> Location: To show weather information precisely based on a location.<br></li><li> Storage: To send watch faces or read and write files in smartphones and SD cards.</li><br><br>[Disclaimer]<br><li> This app is unavailable on the smartwatch below Wear OS 2.0.<br></li><li> Mobile app installation is necessary for smartwatches powered by Wear OS 2.0. or higher.<br></li><li> Some functions of the smartwatch app require interaction with the mobile app.<br></li><li> When logging in to the smartwatch app, check the passcode on the mobile and enter it.</li><br><br><br>TIMEFLIK, A new name for watch face app MR TIME",
